VorT2x is a fork of KAIT2EN (https://github.com/kaiT2en/KaiT2en-Fedora),
taken at commit 30e367b of 2026-11-17. It is an independent project and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by KAIT2EN.

Modified files

All files inherited from KAIT2EN were modified by VorT2x contributors from
2026-11-18 onwards. The KAIT2EN name, paths and identifiers were changed to
VorT2x, the Vornehm desktop theme was renamed Eddy, KAIT2EN's branding and
artwork were replaced, and KAIT2EN's website, blog and wallpapers were left
out. The git history records every change to every file, with its date.

